{
"#name"
:
{
"agent"
:
null
,
"en"
:
"x-cmd AI Agent integration tool"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x agent <subcmd>"
:
null
}
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Integrate x-cmd into Claude, Codex, Cursor, Kimi and other AI tools.\n\nTwo operation modes:\n1. request - Single-shot quick calls for simple Q&A\n2. job - Long-term task iteration with auto-planning and execution\n"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"First-time users should run `x agent setup` for initialization, then `x agent --cfg zero_harness=claude` to set default AI tool\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"Quick start:\n1. `x agent request \"Explain this code\"` —— Single Q&A\n2. `x agent run \"Add unit tests\"` —— Auto-iterate to completion\n3. `x agent run ./agent.md \"Fix the bug\"` —— Run with predefined config\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"Harness is the AI tool interface. Popular options:\n- claude —— Claude Code (most capable, recommended)\n- codex —— OpenAI Codex\n- codex-ds —— OpenAI Codex + DeepSeek model\n- kimi-cli —— Kimi CLI\n- gemini-cli —— Google Gemini\n- opencode —— Open-source multi-model tool\nFull list in `x agent --cfg` hint\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"Job data is saved to `~/.x-cmd/data/agent/job/` by default, one directory per task (timestamp-named)\n\nUse `--job-id` to reference the same task across commands, e.g.:\n\n`x agent run --job-id mytask ./agent.md \"do it\"` then `x agent job status --job-id mytask`\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"claude-code requires 2.1.41+ for `claude auth` subcommand\n\nUpgrade: `x env use claude-code` or `npm install -g @anthropics/claude-code`\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"`tdown` is short for `teardown` — it disassembles the agent setup.\nIt reverses what `setup` did: removes the x-cmd prompts and skill0 symlinks that `setup` installed.\n"
}
]
,
"#subcmd:Agent"
:
[
"request"
,
"chat"
,
"job"
,
"run"
]
,
"#subcmd:Setup"
:
[
"init"
,
"setup"
,
"tdown"
,
"unify"
]
,
"#subcmd:Config"
:
[
"--cfg"
,
"--cur"
]
,
"#subcmd:Util"
:
[
"ps"
,
"isready"
,
"stat"
,
"classify"
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent init"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Initialize and select default AI tool"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent setup"
,
"en"
:
"Example: First-time AI tool setup"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent --cfg zero_harness=claude"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Set Claude as default tool"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent request \"Explain this code\""
,
"en"
:
"Example: Single AI Q&A"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent run \"Add unit tests\""
,
"en"
:
"Example: Create and execute long-term task"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent run ./agent.md \"Fix the bug\""
,
"en"
:
"Example: Run standardized task with config"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent chat --workspace ./myproject"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Start interactive AI chat in a workspace"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent job status --job-id mytask --yml"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Check task status (YAML format)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x agent stat parse claude --session-id <uuid>"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Parse Claude Code session log, extract per-turn cost & efficiency stats"
}
]
,
